    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Come Running Home To You</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catra and Adora's time returning magic to the universe traveling long stretches from planet to planet taught them both to take things slow, to rest, to breathe. It took some time, but they both found that they liked it. Being present in the moment, not thinking too hard about what was needed of them next, not constantly looking for things to keep them busy. Life on its own was itâ€™s own sort of busy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;or&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Domestic pregnancy fluff&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>ScorchFlame</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
